  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Covers JSON Schema Core and Validation at 2020-12 (draft-bhutton-json-schema-01 and draft-bhutton-json-schema-validation-01, 16 June 2022): dialects with $schema and $vocabulary, $id, $anchor, $ref, $dynamicRef and $defs, the applicator and unevaluated vocabularies, the validation, content and meta-data keywords, format as annotation or assertion, the flag, basic, detailed and verbose output formats, and bundling into Compound Schema Documents. Version lines: 2020-12 is current, 2019-09 is supported, draft-07, draft-06 and draft-04 are legacy with upgrade checklists between each, and two previews are tracked: the IETF jsonschema WG draft draft-ietf-jsonschema-json-schema-03 and the unreleased JSON Schema v1/2026 work in json-schema-org/json-schema-spec. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out the version lines, core and references, validation keywords, composition and unevaluated keywords, and format and output.",
